"Compliance & Reporting","description":"Detailed documentation that meets state and federal requirements. Transparent reporting helps you demonstrate fiscal responsibility to constituents."},{"title":"Emergency Response Ready","description":"Rapid mobilization for storm cleanup, emergency debris removal, and disaster response. We're ready when your community needs us most."}],"faqs":[{"question":"Do you work with government procurement processes?","answer":"Yes, we're experienced with municipal RFP processes, cooperative purchasing agreements, and state contracts. We provide all required documentation and can work within your procurement requirements."},{"question":"How do you handle seasonal variations in park usage?","answer":"We adjust service frequency based on seasonal patterns - increasing pickups during summer months and special events, then scaling back during quieter periods to optimize your budget."},{"question":"Can you support our community recycling goals?","answer":"Absolutely. We help municipalities design and implement recycling programs that engage residents, provide educational materials, and track progress toward waste diversion goals."},{"question":"What's your response time for emergency cleanup?","answer":"For municipalities with service agreements, we maintain emergency response protocols with 24-48 hour mobilization for most situations. We prioritize public safety and rapid restoration of services."},{"question":"Do you provide service to all municipal facilities?","answer":"Yes, we can service all municipal buildings and facilities under a single contract - from administrative offices to public works yards, parks, and community centers."}]}],["$L7","$L8","$L9"],"$La"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$Lb",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$c",[]],"S":true}
